# ============================================================
# AI READING — this one setting decides whether OCR and
# WhatsApp document classification work at all.
# ============================================================
# Use ONE of these. Anthropic is tried first when both are set.
#
# Anthropic (Claude) — key MUST start with "sk-ant-"
#   Get one at: console.anthropic.com  → API Keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Google Gemini — key MUST start with "AIza"
#   Get one at: aistudio.google.com/apikey  (free, no card)
#
#   COMMON MISTAKE: a value starting with "AQ." or "ya29." is an OAuth
#   access token, NOT an API key. It will always fail. The app now
#   detects this and tells you, instead of failing silently.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Copy this file to .env.local (same folder) and fill in ONE of the keys
# below, then restart `npm run dev`.
#
# This powers the OCR Scanner's AI-Powered Reading mode, which sends
# document images to a vision-capable AI for much higher accuracy than
# offline OCR — especially on stamped, rotated, or low-quality scans.
#
# Without either key, the OCR Scanner automatically falls back to the
# built-in offline Tesseract OCR pipeline (fully free, works offline, but
# less accurate on messy documents).
#
# IMPORTANT: never commit .env.local to git, and never share these keys
# in chat/email/support tickets — treat them like a password.

# ---- OPTION 1 (recommended — genuinely free, no credit card) ----
# Get a key from https://aistudio.google.com/apikey (sign in with any
# Google account). Google's free tier includes image/document reading.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# ---- OPTION 2 (paid, used only if GEMINI_API_KEY above is empty) ----
# Get a key from https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# Requires adding billing credits to your Anthropic account.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ---- WHATSAPP DOCUMENTS ----
# The same key above also powers the WhatsApp Documents module, which reads
# every invoice, challan, e-way bill, Bill T and weight slip that arrives on
# the linked account and files it by coordination reference.
#
# Without a key, documents are still downloaded and saved — they just land in
# "_Needs Review" unclassified, and you can press Re-scan on them once a key
# is added. Nothing is ever guessed.
#
# Optional: move where documents and the vendor master are stored. Defaults to
# <your user folder>\Documents\Biome Platform on Windows.
# BIOME_DATA_ROOT=
